            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='16'>Cyber Monday, Christmas, and Black Friday deliver 5,000%+ ROI. Six of eight campaign categories underperform the no-campaign baseline — marketing budget concentrates value in 3 calendar events per year. Campaign Marketing ROI</run>
