            <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='16'>Electronics generates 38% of revenue from 20% of SKUs. Groceries and Seasonal together generate 13% — inventory investment should follow revenue concentration, not SKU count.</run>
