          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0a2540' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='22'>XGBoost Forecast vs Actual | 90-Day Holdout | 2.95% MAPE</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='16'>Peak revenue is Dec 21, not Christmas Day. Retailers who forecast a Dec 25 spike over-order inventory and mis-staff the wrong day.</run>
          </formatted-text>
